Bind Npc 24426 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 14426 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 279 "The Knights of Darkness"
    Journal for karus "You will receive 1,500,000 EXP for hunting 20 Doom Soldiers, and 3,500,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given to those who are 75Lv or higher)."
    Journal for elmorad "You will receive 1,500,000 EXP for hunting 20 Doom Soldiers, and 3,500,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given to those who are 75Lv or higher)."
    Kill 20 of 8012

Requires player level >= 60 and player level <= 73

Rewards
    Give 1500000 experience or 3500000 with premium

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I have felt their burning gaze... Their bloodthirsty rage is matched only by their incredible stamina... they're unbearable to be near, let alone fight. Even if you defeat them you'll only do so at great loss..."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's the  Doom SoldierArmy... The resurrection of these guys ain't good news right now, what with us fighting the El Morad Army too. If they hit us from behind... Ah~ isn't there anywhere to make a stand for Karus in Ronark Land...\n\nAhh, that baleful red gaze, dripping with evil bloodthirtyness... It's the Doom Soldiers alright. They're knights too. Darkness Knights..."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I have felt their burning gaze... Their bloodthirsty rage is matched only by their incredible stamina... they're unbearable to be near, let alone fight. Even if you defeat them you'll only do so at great loss..."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's the Doom Soldier Army... The resurrection of these guys ain't good news right now, what with us fighting the Karus too. If they hit us from behind... Ah~ isn't there anywhere for El Morad to make a stand in Ronark Land...\n\nAhh, that baleful red gaze, dripping with evil bloodthirtyness... It's the Doom Soldiers alright. They're knights too. Darkness Knights..."

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Well Master, nice job easing Elrod's mind a little."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Well Master, nice job easing Della's mind a little."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Is it you that confounded the Doom Soldier Armies and drove them back? I never would've guessed you'd become so talented. You're a real asset ...  Your services are most appreciated."
